@node multiband-compressor Plugin Parameters
@section Parameters


@subsection Per-band parameters

The following parameters are repeated for each band:

@subsubheading Dynamics

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .18 .15 .10 .08 .27
@headitem Parameter @tab Type @tab Range @tab Default @tab Unit @tab Description
@item @code{Threshold} @tab Float @tab -60 .. 0 @tab -20 @tab dB @tab Level above which compression starts
@item @code{Ratio} @tab Float @tab 1 .. 20 @tab 4 @tab :1 @tab Compression amount (input:output)
@item @code{Knee} @tab Float @tab 0 .. 20 @tab 6 @tab dB @tab Softness of threshold transition
@end multitable


@subsubheading Timing

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .18 .15 .10 .08 .27
@headitem Parameter @tab Type @tab Range @tab Default @tab Unit @tab Description
@item @code{Attack} @tab Float @tab 0.1 .. 100 @tab 5 @tab ms @tab Time to reach full compression
@item @code{Release} @tab Float @tab 10 .. 1000 @tab 50 @tab ms @tab Time to return to unity gain
@item @code{Lookahead} @tab Float @tab 0 .. 20 @tab 0 @tab ms @tab Pre-delay for transient catching
@item @code{Program Dependent Release} @tab Bool @tab On / Off @tab Off @tab - @tab Adapts release to signal content
@end multitable


@subsubheading Output

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .18 .15 .10 .08 .27
@headitem Parameter @tab Type @tab Range @tab Default @tab Unit @tab Description
@item @code{Makeup Gain} @tab Float @tab -24 .. 24 @tab 0 @tab dB @tab Post-compression gain boost
@item @code{Mix} @tab Float @tab 0 .. 1 @tab 1 @tab % @tab Dry/wet blend (parallel comp)
@item @code{Auto Makeup} @tab Bool @tab On / Off @tab Off @tab - @tab Auto-compensate for gain reduction
@item @code{Measured Auto Makeup} @tab Bool @tab On / Off @tab Off @tab - @tab Makeup based on measured reduction
@end multitable


@subsubheading Channels

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .18 .15 .10 .08 .27
@headitem Parameter @tab Type @tab Range @tab Default @tab Unit @tab Description
@item @code{Link Channels} @tab Bool @tab On / Off @tab Linked @tab - @tab Stereo-link detector for L/R
@end multitable


@subsubheading Sidechain

@multitable @columnfractions .22 .18 .15 .10 .08 .27
@headitem Parameter @tab Type @tab Range @tab Default @tab Unit @tab Description
@item @code{Sidechain HPF} @tab Float @tab 0 .. 200 @tab 80 @tab Hz @tab High-pass on detector input
@item @code{Sidechain HPF Order} @tab Choice (2nd, 4th) @tab 2 options @tab 2nd @tab - @tab Butterworth HPF slope
@item @code{Detection Mode} @tab Choice (Peak, RMS) @tab 2 options @tab Peak @tab - @tab Peak or RMS level detection
@item @code{External Sidechain} @tab Bool @tab On / Off @tab Off @tab - @tab Use external signal for detection
@end multitable


@strong{Structural parameters} (Bands, Preset, Crossover 1, Crossover 2, Crossover 3, Crossover 4) require rebuilding the plugin when changed. Other parameters update in real-time with zero dropout.

@node multiband-compressor Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

SOTF Multiband Compressor plugin for multiband dynamic range compression.

Splits the signal into frequency bands and applies independent compression to each band for frequency-selective dynamics control.

@subsubheading Parameter wiring

All parameters reach the audio thread through the host's @code{rebuild_cached_parameters} / @code{set_parameter} / @code{get_parameter} triad. Structural parameters (marked in the notes below) trigger a rebuild; the rest update in real time with zero dropouts.

